{"ticker":"BX","updated":"2026-10-23T22:42:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Blackstone Inc.","shortName":"Blackstone Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.blackstone.com","fullTimeEmployees":5285,"marketCap":141009289216,"trailingPE":26.273943,"forwardPE":15.985766,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.917581,"pegRatio":1.07,"targetMeanPrice":138.27274,"targetHighPrice":169.0,"targetLowPrice":118.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.001,"earningsGrowth":0.039,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.49065,"profitMargins":0.22492,"totalRevenue":15812504576,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":165.14,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":101.73,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.4},"summary":"Blackstone Inc. is an alternative asset management firm specializing in private equity, venture capital, real estate, hedge fund solutions, credit, secondary funds of funds, public debt and equity and multi-asset class strategies. The firm typically invests in early-stage, seed, middle market, mature, late venture, growth capital, emerging growth, turnaround, and later stage companies. It also provide capital markets services. The real estate segment specializes in opportunistic, core+ investments as well as debt investment opportunities collateralized by commercial real estate, and stabilized income-oriented commercial real estate across North America, Europe and Asia. Within fund of fund investments, it seeks to invest in private equity funds, venture capital funds, mezzanine funds, distressed debt/turnaround funds, secondary investment funds & real estate funds. The firm's corporate private equity business pursues transactions throughout the world across a variety of transaction types, including large buyouts, recapitalization, special situations, distressed mortgage loans, mid-cap buyouts, buy and build platforms, which involves multiple acquisitions behind a single management team and platform, and growth equity/development projects involving significant majority stakes in portfolio companies and minority investments in operating companies, shipping, real estate, corporate","summary_zh":"Blackstone Inc. 是一家另類資產管理公司，專注於私募股權、風險投資、房地產、對沖基金解決方案、信貸、二級基金中的基金、公共債務和股票以及多資產類別策略。該公司通常投資於早期、種子、中期市場、成熟、後期風險、成長資本、新興成長、轉型和後期公司。它還提供資本市場服務。房地產部門專注於機會主義、核心+投資以及以商業房地產為抵押的債務投資機會，以及北美、歐洲和亞洲穩定的收入導向商業房地產。在基金投資領域，它尋求投資私募股權基金、創投基金、夾層基金、不良債務/週轉基金、二級投資基金和房地產基金。該公司的企業私募股權業務在全球範圍內開展各種交易類型的交易，包括大型收購、資本重組、特殊情況、不良抵押貸款、中型企業收購、購買和建設平台（其中涉及單一管理團隊和平台背後的多次收購）以及涉及投資組合公司的大部分股權和營運公司、航運、房地產、企業的少數投資的成長股權/開發項目。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":169.56,"h":171.91,"l":169.25,"c":169.5,"v":2801100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":168.82,"h":171.6,"l":168.14,"c":171.43,"v":3563600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":171.05,"h":172.57,"l":170.69,"c":171.64,"v":2052800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":172.0,"h":173.55,"l":171.7,"c":172.02,"v":2667600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":172.42,"h":173.0,"l":170.35,"c":171.4,"v":1943600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":167.63,"h":169.89,"l":165.32,"c":169.55,"v":3512300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":169.45,"h":169.97,"l":165.56,"c":167.34,"v":2450700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":168.26,"h":170.37,"l":167.58,"c":169.9,"v":2548200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":172.97,"h":173.46,"l":167.75,"c":169.99,"v":3110400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":170.64,"h":173.65,"l":169.8,"c":173.3,"v":3085200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":172.62,"h":175.8,"l":172.45,"c":173.17,"v":2958100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":174.98,"h":179.69,"l":174.56,"c":178.23,"v":4345800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":178.53,"h":186.65,"l":178.53,"c":183.92,"v":6395800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":182.99,"h":183.69,"l":180.16,"c":181.35,"v":3356200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":181.8,"h":184.13,"l":181.4,"c":183.8,"v":2818400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":184.45,"h":185.14,"l":183.33,"c":183.72,"v":2924300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":184.07,"h":187.56,"l":182.5,"c":183.62,"v":4719200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":184.77,"h":190.09,"l":184.46,"c":188.68,"v